0.05  Bounded relationship loading and concurrency
      - Apply eager-load limits and offsets per parent, including compound pivots.
      - Add nested where_has, or_where_has, and where_doesnt_have.
      - Support composite many-to-many keys and transactional sync.
      - Add opt-in atomic create/update by unique model identity.
      - Serialize migration writers across sessions and add read-only schema import.
      - Add a four-engine CI matrix, user guide, and top-N benchmark.

0.04  Composite identities and cursor batches
      - Support multi-column model keys, guarded instance writes, and key lookups.
      - Support multi-column has_one, has_many, and belongs_to including eager loading.
      - Add chunk_by_cursor for bounded export and processing jobs.
      - Benchmark an eager-loaded relationship payload against DBIx::Class.

0.03  Seed data
      - Add standalone seeder scaffolding and execution by named connection.
      - Validate seed files before a batch and run its data writes in one transaction.

0.02  First standalone release
      - Remove the framework dependency and introduce Yggdrasil::Collection.
      - Add explicitly bound model APIs for named connections and multiple managers.
      - Add keyset pagination without COUNT and validate offset pagination inputs.
      - Keep mandatory soft-delete, relationship and cursor scopes separate from user ORs.
      - Reject unsafe write shapes and accidental stored primary-key changes.
      - Improve transaction failure handling, pivot sync and migration previews.
      - Redact bindings in callback logs by default and select DBD::MariaDB explicitly.
